     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How to use the KRL",
     "texto": [
      "**KRL** is the abbreviation of **Kereta Rel Listrik**, the electric commuter train. Instructions usually order the steps with **pertama** (\"first\") and **kemudian** (\"then\")."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Safety rules",
     "texto": [
      "**Dilarang membawa senjata tajam** is a formal notice. **Jangan membawa senjata tajam** speaks directly to the person. The verb does not change according to who receives the instruction."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
